<figure class="fig-tight">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 330 232" role="img" aria-label="Fig P04.2 — the parabola y = (x + 5)² + 16 from x = −13 to 3: vertex (−5, 16) on the dashed minimum, climbing to 80 at both ends">
<line x1="267.5" y1="14" x2="267.5" y2="218" stroke="#555f6e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
